						 <p>(sorry for the necro)<br /> yeah that's how I'm reading it, though I still don't quite understand why he would shoot Schaffer&#8230; then again it seems like he's confusing the toaster and people referring to it by some secondary effect, so maybe he was actually trying to shoot the toaster but got misdirected?</p> <p>This one is really freaking confusing to me, and that's saying something considering some of the confusing shit we've got around here.</p> 
